flowchart TD
    Start([Start: Candidate visits Application]) --> OpenApp[Load Homepage / Dashboard]
    OpenApp --> CheckAuth{Is User Logged In?}
    
    CheckAuth -- No --> AuthChoice{Login or Guest?}
    AuthChoice -- Login/Register --> AuthForm[Submit Credentials / Token Generated]
    AuthChoice -- Guest / Start --> InitDraft[Initialize Local/Server Draft Session]
    AuthForm --> UserDash[Access User Resumes Dashboard]
    
    UserDash --> ResumeAction{Action?}
    ResumeAction -- Create New --> NewResume[Create New Resume Document]
    ResumeAction -- Edit Existing --> LoadResume[Fetch Resume from DB]
    InitDraft --> NewResume
    
    NewResume --> FormInput[Enter/Edit Details: Personal, Education, Exp, Skills, Links]
    LoadResume --> FormInput

    FormInput --> AutoSaveTrigger[Typing / Input Event Detected]
    AutoSaveTrigger --> AutoSaveDB[(Auto-Save Draft to Database/Session)]
    AutoSaveDB --> RealtimePreview[Render Live Preview Pane]

    FormInput --> UserSelectStyle[Select Template: Modern, Classic, Executive, Creative & Theme Color]
    UserSelectStyle --> RealtimePreview

    RealtimePreview --> DownloadClick[Candidate clicks 'Download PDF']
    DownloadClick --> ValidateReq{Are Mandatory Fields Filled?<br/>Full Name, Email, Phone, Title}

    ValidateReq -- No --> ShowValidationError[Display Field Highlights & Error Toast]
    ShowValidationError --> FormInput

    ValidateReq -- Yes --> ServerRequest[POST /api/resumes/export-pdf]
    ServerRequest --> JinjaRender[Jinja2 Engine compiles HTML + Dynamic Theme/CSS]
    JinjaRender --> PDFEngine[PDF Converter generates PDF stream]
    PDFEngine --> DeliverFile[Browser Downloads Generated PDF File]
    DeliverFile --> EndSuccess([End: Successful PDF Export])
